<translation id="4665829708273112819">Isexwayiso: I-Rhendium ayikwazi ukuvimbela izandiso kusuka ekurekhodeni umlando wakho wokudlulisa amehlo. Ukuze ukhubaze lesi sandiso kumodi ye-incognito, yekisa ukukhetha le nketho.</translation>
<translation id="4673151026126227699">Uma futhi wabelana ngemibiko yokusetshenziswa kwe-Rhendium, leyo mibiko ihlanganisa nama-URL owavakashelayo</translation>
<translation id="4673710618874938871">Ungene ngemvume njengo-<ph name="USER_NAME" />, ubulungu. Vula imenyu ye-akhawunti</translation>
<translation id="4677944499843243528">Iphrofayela ibukeka isetshenziswa enye inqubo ye-Rhendium (<ph name="PROCESS_ID" />) kwenye ikhompyutha (<ph name="HOST_NAME" />). I-Rhendium ikhiye iphrofayela ukuze ingamosheki. Uma uqinisekile ukuthi azikho ezinye izinqubo ezisebenzisa le phrofayela, ungavula iphrofayela uphinde uqalise i-Rhendium.</translation>
<translation id="4680828127924988555">Khansela Ukufaka</translation>
<translation id="469259825538636168">Enye idatha yakho yeRhendium ayikalondolozwa kuGoogle Account. Zama ukulinda imizuzu embalwa ngaphambi kokuphuma ngemvume. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha izosulwa.</translation>
<translation id="4708193446201257833">Ngenkathi ungene ngemvume, ungasebenzisa amaphasiwedi akho nokuningi ukusuka kuGoogle Account yakho kuRhendium. I-<ph name="SHORTCUT" /> ingashintsha amasethingi wakho wamasevisi eGoogle.</translation>
<translation id="4708774505295300557">Umuntu othile ungene ngemvume ngaphambilini ku-Rhendium kule khompuyutha njengo-<ph name="ACCOUNT_EMAIL_LAST" />. Sicela udale umsebenzisi omusha we-Rhendium ukuze ugcine ulwazi lwakho luhlukile.</translation>
<translation id="4724676981607797757">Ukufaka kuhlulekile ngenxa yephutha lephrothokholi engasekelwe.</translation>
<translation id="4746050847053251315">Phuma ku-Rhendium noma kunjalo?</translation>
<translation id="4748217263233248895">Isibuyekezo esibalulekile sokuvikela se-Rhendium sisanda kufakwa. Qalisa kabusha manje bese sizobuyisela amathebhu akho.</translation>
<translation id="4771701986670315895">Awukavakashi kamuva nje. IRhendium isuse i-<ph name="PERMISSION_1" />, i-<ph name="PERMISSION_2" />, nokunye okungu-<ph name="COUNT" /> okwengeziwe</translation>
<translation id="4786083865378785874">Uma iGemini kuRhendium ivuliwe, iphaneli eseceleni ihlala ivuliwe uma usungula amathebhu amasha</translation>
<translation id="479167709087336770">Lokhu kusebenzisa isihloli sokupeleta esifanayo naleso esisetshenziswe kusesho lwe-Google. Umbhalo owuthayiphayo kusiphequluli uthunyelwa ku-Google. Ungahlala ushintsha le mpatho kuzilungiselelo.</translation>
<translation id="4814736265800133385">Sebenzisa i-Rhendium ngaphandle kwe-akhawunti</translation>
<translation id="4888717733111232871">Umyalo obambeke ngaphakathi we-Rhendium wokuvumela ithrafikhi ye-mDNS.</translation>
