<translation id="4943838377383847465">I-Rhendium kumodi yasemuva.</translation>
<translation id="494490797786467921">Chofoza ukuze uvale ibhokisi lokungena ngemvume leRhendium</translation>
<translation id="4950660488495335294">Ngamaphrofayela weRhendium ungahlukanisa zonke izinto zakho zeRhendium. Sungula amaphrofayela wabangane nomndeni, noma uhlukanise phakathi komsebenzi nobumnandi.</translation>
<translation id="4987820182225656817">Izihambeli zingasebenzisa i-Rhendium ngaphandle kokushiya noma yini ngemuva.</translation>
