<translation id="5123973130450702873">IRhendium idinga imvume ukuze ilandelele izandla zakho</translation>
<translation id="5141988424377517949">Awukavakashi kamuva nje. IRhendium isuse i-<ph name="PERMISSION_1" />, i-<ph name="PERMISSION_2" />, i-<ph name="PERMISSION_3" />.</translation>
<translation id="5174969993834422967">Uvamise ukuvimba izaziso. Ukuze uvumele leli sayithi ukuthi likwazise, chofoza isithonjana sesaziso ekhoneni elingakwesokudla lebha yendawo yakho.</translation>
