<translation id="5346389065299425353">Julisa usesho lwakho ngokufaka amathebhu amaningi, amafayela, namathuluzi</translation>
<translation id="5348677704241861105">Thola amazwibela asheshayo ale dokhumenti bese ubuza imibuzo ngeGemini kuRhendium</translation>
<translation id="5352264705793813212">I-Rhendium ithole izincomo ezithile zokuphepha zokubuyekeza kwakho</translation>
<translation id="5352361688875342522">Amanye Amaphrofayela e-Rhendium</translation>
<translation id="535243042947607642">IRhendiumOS ayikwazanga ukulondoloza idatha yeRhendium kuGoogle Account yakho ngoba imininingwane yakho yokungena ngemvume ku-akhawunti iphelelwe yisikhathi</translation>
<translation id="5358375970380395591">Ungena ngemvume nge-akhawunti ephethwe futhi unikeza umlawuli wayo ukulawula okungaphezulu kwephrofayela yakho ye-Rhendium. Idatha yakho ye-Rhendium, efana nezinhlelo zakho zokusebenza, amabhukhimakhi, umlando, amaphasiwedi, nezinye izilungiselelo zizoboshezelwa unaphakade ku-<ph name="USER_NAME" />. Uzokwazi ukususa le datha nge-Ideshibhodi yama-Akhawunti we-Google, kodwa ngeke uze ukwazi ukuhlobanisa le datha nenye i-akhawunti. <ph name="LEARN_MORE" /></translation>
<translation id="5368118228313795342">Ikhodi eyengeziwe: <ph name="EXTRA_CODE" />.</translation>
<translation id="5377622451696208284">Ukuze uthole ukwenza ngokomuntu ngamunye, okufaka i-Rhendium Kumsebenzi Wewebhu nowe-App</translation>
