<translation id="5427571867875391349">Setha i-Rhendium njengesiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="5438241569118040789"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /> - Rhendium Beta</translation>
<translation id="5460618461609401056">{NUM_TABS,plural, =1{IRhendium Incoma Ukumisa Ithebhu Enciphisa Ijubane Lebhrawuza Yakho}one{IRhendium Incoma Ukumisa Amathebhu Anciphisa Ijubane Lebhrawuza Yakho}other{IRhendium Incoma Ukumisa Amathebhu Anciphisa Ijubane Lebhrawuza Yakho}}</translation>
<translation id="5473971139929175403">I-Rhendium kungenzeka ingasebenzi ngokufanelekile ngoba ayisasekelwa kule sistimu yokusatshalaliswa kwe-Linux</translation>
<translation id="5475924890392386523">I-Rhendium ivimbele lokhu kudawuniloda ngoba ifayela lingalimaza ama-akhawunti wakho omuntu siqu nawenethiwekhi yokuxhumana nomphakathi</translation>
<translation id="549669000822060376">Sicela ulinde ngenkathi i-Rhendium ifaka izibuyekezo zesistimu zakamuva.</translation>
<translation id="5496810170689441661">I-Rhendium izama ukuhlela amaphasiwedi. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="549975168243349205">Sebenza ngaphandle kokuphazamiseka ngama-app akho ayintandokazi njengeGoogle Drive neYouTube usendleleni ngeRhendium.</translation>
<translation id="5524890928877629608">ikhona elingaphezulu ngakwesokunxele lendawo yokusesha: ngakwesokunxele okungu-<ph name="LEFT" />%, phezulu okungu<ph name="TOP" />%</translation>
<translation id="5527463683072221100">Vula ama-PDF ku-Rhendium</translation>
<translation id="5536164441519929134">Buza<ph name="LINE_BREAK" />mayelana nale thebhu</translation>
<translation id="555970465369471303">Ukuvikeleka, iRhendium ivala ukulungiselela kweJavaScript uma uvakashela isayithi okokuqala ngqa.

Uma leli khasi lingasebenzi njengoba kulindelekile, zama ukuvumela ukulungiselela.</translation>
<translation id="5575874067957905201">Bonisa iGemini kuRhendium kubha yemenyu yeMac bese uvula isinqamuleli sekhibhodi</translation>
<translation id="5579324208890605088">Iphutha ekuqaliseni: sicela usebenzise isifaki njengomsebenzisi ovamile, hhayi njengomlawuli.</translation>
<translation id="5580770360767802657">Sebenzisa iRhendium ngokuzenzakalelayo futhi uyenze iphinwe</translation>
<translation id="5596627076506792578">Izinketho eziningi</translation>
<translation id="5605834417512968703">Khetha noma yini ukuze useshe Ngosesho Lomfanekiso noma ucindezele u-escape ukuze uphume Kusesho Lomfanekiso</translation>
<translation id="5618818588972826921">Khetha noma yimuphi umbhalo noma isithombe ukuze useshe Ngosesho Lwezithombe noma cindezela u-escape ukuze uphume Oseshweni Lwezithombe</translation>
<translation id="5623402015214259806">{0,plural, =0{Isibuyekezo se-Rhendium siyatholakala}=1{Isibuyekezo se-Rhendium siyatholakala}one{Isibuyekezo se-Rhendium sitholakala ngezinsuku ezingu-#}other{Isibuyekezo se-Rhendium sitholakala ngezinsuku ezingu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="5643865575100044307">Yisule njalo idatha yesayithi kudivayisi yakho lapho uvala i-Rhendium</translation>
<translation id="5653831366781983928">Sicela uqalise kabusha i-Rhendium manje</translation>
<translation id="5690427481109656848">I-Google LLC</translation>
<translation id="5698481217667032250">Veza i-Rhendium ngalolu limi</translation>
<translation id="569897634095159764">Ayikwazi ukuxhuma ku-inthanethi Iseva elibamba idinga ukufakazela ubuqiniso.</translation>
<translation id="5768371961535086509">IRhendium ikhulula inkumbulo kumathebhu angasebenzi. Lokhu kunikeza amathebhu asebenzayo namanye ama-app izinsiza zekhompyutha ezengeziwe futhi kugcina iRhendium ishesha. Amathebhu akho angasebenzi aphinde asebenze ngokuzenzekela uma ubuyela kuwo. <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Funda kabanzi mayelana Nesilondolozi Senkumbulo<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="5775198138441669627">Uma ukhohlwa umushwana wakho wokungena noma ufuna ukushintsha le sethingi, <ph name="SETTINGS_LINK" /> idatha yeRhendium ku-akhawunti yakho</translation>
<translation id="5800158606660203929">Yenza ngokwezifiso uphinde ulawule i-Rhendium. Setha i-Rhendium njengokwakho okuzenzakalelayo.</translation>
<translation id="5802618941556161431">Gcina amaphasiwedi wakho, amabhukhimakhi, nomlando kuvunyelaniswe ngokuphelele kuwo wonke amadivayisi ngokusetha iRhendium njengebhrawuza yakho ezenzakalelayo.</translation>
<translation id="5809516625706423866">Ayikwazi ukuxhuma ku-inthanethi I-HTTP 401 Ayigunyaziwe. Sicela uchekhe ukulungiselelwa kommeleli wakho.</translation>
<translation id="5817952762723416573">Isheshisa amasayithi ngenjini yeRhendium V8 kodwa yenza iRhendium imelane kancane nokuhlaselwa. Le sethingi livaliwe.</translation>
<translation id="5821520528363214608">Ukuze usebenzise futhi ulondoloze idatha yeRhendium kuGoogle Account yakho, buyekeza iRhendium</translation>
