<translation id="6174920971222007286">Leli fayela kungenzeka libe nobungozi<ph name="LINE_BREAK" />I-Rhendium ingakuhlolela lokhu okudawunilodwayo uma unikeza iphasiwedi. Ulwazi mayelana nefayela luthunyelwa kokuthi Ukuphequlula ngokuphephile kwe-Google, kodwa okuqukethwe kufayela kanye nephasiwedi kusala kudivayisi yakho.</translation>
