<translation id="6669284030132180248">Uma futhi ulondoloza amabhukhimakhi ku-Google Account yakho, ungakwazi ukulandelela izintengo zomkhiqizo ku-Rhendium futhi waziswe uma intengo yehla.</translation>
<translation id="6676384891291319759">Finyelela i-inthanethi?</translation>
<translation id="668175097507315160">I-RhendiumOS ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho yenxa yephutha lokungena ngemvume.</translation>
