<translation id="6717134281241384636">Iphrofayela yakho ayikwazi ukusetshenziswa ngoba isuka kunguqulo entsha ye-Rhendium.

Ezinye izici kungenzeka zingatholakali. Sicela ucacise umkhombandlela wephrofayela ehlukile noma usebenzise inguqulo entsha ye-Rhendium.</translation>
<translation id="6729124504294600478">Ukuze uthole ukwenza ngokomuntu ngamunye nezinye izakhi, ezifaka i-Rhendium Kumsebenzi wewebhu nowe-app nakumasevisi alinkiwe e-Google</translation>
<translation id="6734291798041940871">I-Rhendium isivele ifakiwe kubo bonke abasebenzisi kukhompuyutha yakho.</translation>
<translation id="6742093177587589736">Ukuze uthole amabhukhimakhi nokuningi kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuRhendium. Le bhokhimakhi izolondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho ngemva kokungena ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="6751374565094704799">Isheshisa amasayithi ngenjini yeRhendium V8 kodwa yenza iRhendium imelane kancane nokuhlaselwa. Le sethingi livuliwe.</translation>
<translation id="6754665438209053659">{count,plural, =1{Enye idatha yakho yeRhendium ayikalondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho njengamanje. Zama ukulinda imizuzu embalwa ngaphambi kokuphuma ngemvume. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha (into e-1) izosulwa.}one{Enye idatha yakho yeRhendium ayikalondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho njengamanje. Zama ukulinda imizuzu embalwa ngaphambi kokuphuma ngemvume. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha (izinto ezingu-{count}) izosulwa.}other{Enye idatha yakho yeRhendium ayikalondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho njengamanje. Zama ukulinda imizuzu embalwa ngaphambi kokuphuma ngemvume. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha (izinto ezingu-{count}) izosulwa.}}</translation>
<translation id="67706546131546258">I-Rhendium incoma ukuthi uskene leli fayela ngenxa yokuthi kungenzeka ukuthi liyingozi.</translation>
