<translation id="6948031725951063910">Ufinyelele umkhawulo weRhendium wamabhukhimakhi angu-<ph name="BOOKMARK_LIMIT" />, ngakho amanye amabhukhimakhi akho awakalondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho okwamanje.

Amabhukhimakhi amasha awakwazi ukulondolozwa e-akhawuntini yakho uze usule amanye. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, amabhukhimakhi angalondoloziwe azosulwa.</translation>
