<translation id="7296334833518879294">Ukuze wabelane ngomsindo wohlelo, vula Amasethingi Ohlelo bese uvumela okuthi 'Ukurekhodwa Komsindo Wohlelo Kuphela' kuRhendium. Ngemva kwalokho kuzodingeka uqale kabusha iRhendium.</translation>
<translation id="731795002583552498">Ibuyekeza i-Rhendium</translation>
