<translation id="8941642502866065432">Ayikwazi ukubuyekeza i-Rhendium</translation>
<translation id="8944232836376404813">Lesi senzo sizokwenza lokhu:
          <ph name="LINE_BREAKS" />
            • Setha kabusha ikhasi lakho lokuqalisa, ikhasi lethebhu entsha, injini yokusesha namathebhu aphiniwe
            <ph name="LINE_BREAK" />
            • Vala izandiso
            <ph name="LINE_BREAK" />
            • Sula amakhukhi nenye idatha yesikhashana yesayithi
            <ph name="LINE_BREAKS" />
            Amabhukhimakhi, umlando, namaphasiwedi alondoloziwe ngeke aze athinteke.</translation>
<translation id="897581876605952338">Ilogo ye-Rhendium Enterprise</translation>
<translation id="8980139959902937527">Yenza iGoogle iphephe usendleleni nge-app yeRhendium ku-<ph name="DEVICE_TYPE" /> yakho</translation>
<translation id="8981150672034878610">Ayikwazi ukuqala iRhendium ngoba kukhona okungahambanga kahle lapho uvula iphrofayela yakho. Zama ukuqala kabusha iRhendium.</translation>
<translation id="8988036198400390003">Phatha amaphrofayela e-Rhendium</translation>
<translation id="9018218886431812662">Ukufaka kuqedile</translation>
<translation id="9019929317751753759">Ukuze senze i-Rhendium iphephe, sikhubaza isandiso esilandelayo esingafakiwe kuhlu lwe-<ph name="IDS_EXTENSION_WEB_STORE_TITLE" /> futhi kungenzeka singezwe ngaphandle kolwazi lakho.</translation>
<translation id="9022552996538154597">Ngena ngemvume ku-Rhendium</translation>
<translation id="904366664621834601">I-Rhendium ivimbele lokhu kudawuniloda ngoba ifayela lengobo yomlando lihlanganisa namanye amafayela angase afihle uhlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha</translation>
<translation id="9053882453960391422">Gcina amaphasiwedi akho, amabhukhimakhi, nomlando kuvunyelaniswe ngokuphelele kuwo wonke amadivayisi. Finyelela kalula izakhi ozaziyo nozithandayo ngokubuyekeza ibhrawuza yakho evuleka ngokuzenzakalelayo ibe yiRhendium. IRhendium izophinwa kutaskbar yakho ukuze ifinyeleleke ngokushesha.</translation>
<translation id="9056398481763999048">Sebenzisa amathuluzi e-AI ahamba phambili eGoogle nge-app yeRhendium efonini yakho</translation>
<translation id="9062666675513499497">Ngena ngemvume ku-Rhendium uma ungena ngemvume kwamanye amasevisi e-Google</translation>
<translation id="9078733879136747090">I-Rhendium ivalwe ngokuzenzekelayo</translation>
<translation id="9089354809943900324">I-Rhendium ayikho kudethi</translation>
<translation id="9093206154853821181">{0,plural, =1{I-Rhendium izoqalisa kabusha phakathi kwehora}one{I-Rhendium izoqalisa kabusha emahoreni angu-#}other{I-Rhendium izoqalisa kabusha emahoreni angu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="9106236359747881194">Khetha umbhalo ozowusesha</translation>
<translation id="9106612006984859720">Ukuze uthole izibuyekezo zesikhathi esizayo ze-Rhendium, uzodinga i-Windows 10 noma yakamuva. Le khompyutha isebenzisa i-Windows 8.1.</translation>
<translation id="91086099826398415">Vula isixhumanisi ku&amp;thebhu entsha ye-Rhendium</translation>
<translation id="911206726377975832">Phinda ususe idatha yakho yokudlulisa amehlo?</translation>
