<translation id="9148058034647219655">Phuma</translation>
<translation id="9155105544013854680">Qhubeka lapho ogcine khona: IRhendium ingabuyisela amathebhu akho njalo lapho uqala kabusha. Ukuze ukuvule lokhu, iya ku-</translation>
<translation id="9158494823179993217">Umlawuli wesistimu yakho ulungise i-Rhendium ukuthi ivule esinye isiphequluli ukufinyelela i-<ph name="TARGET_URL_HOSTNAME" />.</translation>
<translation id="9185526690718004400">Qalisa kabusha ukuze ubuyekeze i-&amp;Rhendium</translation>
